message: "If you use DocForge Local, please cite this software using the metadata below. If a paper for this project is published later, prefer citing the paper in addition to or instead of the software release, as indicated by future updates to this file."
title: "DocForge Local"
type: software

authors:
  - name: "center4aai"

version: "0.1.3"
license: "MIT"

abstract: >
  DocForge Local is a local-first CLI for generating repository documentation
  from deterministic implementation evidence, writing Markdown artifacts, and
  publishing a local MkDocs Material site. LLM-assisted generation is optional
  and uses a user-controlled OpenAI-compatible endpoint.

keywords:
  - repository documentation
  - docs-as-code
  - cli
  - mkdocs
  - deterministic analysis
  - software documentation
  - claim-evidence alignment

url: "https://github.com/center4aai/docforge-local"

date-released: 2026-04-20
